WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.250
Two gardens each have a
fence all the way round.

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:07.650
Garden one is eight metres
long and five metres wide.

3
00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:11.510
Garden two is nine metres
long and four metres wide.

4
00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:15.070
Both fences use exactly
the same length of fencing.

5
00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:18.570
So do both gardens have the
same amount of grass inside?

6
00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:20.650
Or does one hold more?

7
00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:23.210
In this mission, you'll
find the perimeter,

8
00:00:23.260 --> 00:00:24.810
the distance around a shape.

9
00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:27.770
You'll find the area,
the space inside,

10
00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:29.810
for rectangles and triangles.

11
00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:33.770
And you'll find the volume
of a cuboid, like a box.

12
00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:37.150
Your mission: decide which
garden has more grass,

13
00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:39.220
or whether it is a tie.
